        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Roberto Sánchez-Ocampo, Sandro, Julio Saraceni, Elena Sedova\n- Works: The Desire to Live\n- Topics: Argentine film, romantic musical films, Argentine music and acting\n\nFacts:\n- Roberto Sánchez-Ocampo was born on August 19, 1945, and later became known by the artist names Sandro, Sandro de América, Gitano, and the Argentine Elvis.\n- Roberto Sánchez-Ocampo was a notable Argentine singer and actor.\n- The Desire to Live, also titled El Deseo de vivir in Spanish, is a 1973 Argentine romantic musical film.\n- The Desire to Live was directed by Julio Saraceni.\n- The Desire to Live starred Sandro and Elena Sedova.\n- Roberto Sánchez-Ocampo died on January 4, 2010.",
